<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Maximus started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Maximus started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it initiated coverage of Maximus Inc with a buy rating and a 12-month price target of $27.</p>
<p>-- shares were up 3/8 to 19-1/2.</p>
